  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how's your day going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_03",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm interviewing my first guest on my podcast tomorrow. How do I ask good questions?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ask open questions, ones that can't be answered with yes or no. Start with how or what, or tell me about.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Like, tell me about the first time you baked?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.28,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. Then listen and follow up on what they say, rather than rushing to your next question.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm scared of awkward silences.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.29,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Silences are often when guests say the best things. Count to three in your head before jumping in.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hang on, should I send them the questions beforehand?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 3.11,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_15",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Send the topics, not the exact questions. That keeps answers natural.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
